[
  {
    "uid": "C0588",
    "text": "No procedure solves every halting case",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2889,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder italic caption",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-computation-limit",
        "field": "item.label"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0589",
    "text": "A transmitted signal can lose distinctions needed to recover the message. Communication design must protect those distinctions, not just send something detectable.",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2890,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder body",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-communication-problem",
        "field": "text"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0590",
    "text": "A transmitted message can lose distinctions",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2891,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder italic caption",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-communication-problem",
        "field": "item.label"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0591",
    "text": "The message includes enough structured extra information to recover from the specified error patterns. It cannot repair every possible corruption or prove that the message is true.",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2892,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder body",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-error-correcting-message",
        "field": "text"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0592",
    "text": "A message designed to recover from specified errors",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2893,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder italic caption",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-error-correcting-message",
        "field": "item.label"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0593",
    "text": "The machine uses measurements of its effects to adjust what it does. Responding to feedback does not by itself establish understanding or unlimited authority.",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2894,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder body",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-feedback-control",
        "field": "text"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0594",
    "text": "A machine responds to its measured effects",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2895,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder italic caption",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-feedback-control",
        "field": "item.label"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0595",
    "text": "In Borges's imagined case, comparing the later page with Cervantes confirms that every word matches. That settles the wording while leaving questions about authorship and interpretation open.",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2896,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder body",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-word-identical-page",
        "field": "text"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0596",
    "text": "The collation finds the same words",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2897,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder italic caption",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-word-identical-page",
        "field": "item.label"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0597",
    "text": "In Borges's imagined case, identical words acquire a different meaning through a later author and context. This does not mean every interpretation is equally well supported.",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2898,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder body",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-another-work",
        "field": "text"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0598",
    "text": "The same words can become another work",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2899,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder italic caption",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-another-work",
        "field": "item.label"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0599",
    "text": "A map that reproduces everything at full size loses the usefulness of selection. More detail is not always a better guide.",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2900,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder body",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-useless-total-map",
        "field": "text"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0600",
    "text": "More detail can destroy a map\u2019s usefulness",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2901,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder italic caption",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-useless-total-map",
        "field": "item.label"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0601",
    "text": "A story can keep incompatible paths open instead of selecting one ending. Its branching resembles a diagram of ancestry without being the same kind of explanation.",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2902,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder body",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-branching-fiction",
        "field": "text"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0602",
    "text": "A narrative can keep incompatible paths open",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2903,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder italic caption",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-branching-fiction",
        "field": "item.label"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0603",
    "text": "A work of fiction can imitate editions, notes and references. Scholarly appearance alone is not enough to authenticate a claim.",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2904,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder body",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-fictional-archive",
        "field": "text"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0604",
    "text": "The apparatus of scholarship becomes fiction",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2905,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder italic caption",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-fictional-archive",
        "field": "item.label"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0605",
    "text": "A copy changes how and where a work is encountered. Reproduction raises questions about presence, tradition and access beyond the technical ability to make copies.",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2906,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder body",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-aura-and-reproduction",
        "field": "text"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0606",
    "text": "A copy changes the encounter with a work",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2907,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder italic caption",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-aura-and-reproduction",
        "field": "item.label"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0607",
    "text": "Reproduction can extend art's audience and alter its political uses. Those changes cannot all be reduced to either liberation or decline.",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2908,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder body",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-politics-of-the-copy",
        "field": "text"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0608",
    "text": "Reproduction changes art\u2019s political reach",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2909,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder italic caption",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-politics-of-the-copy",
        "field": "item.label"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0609",
    "text": "Moral language has a history shaped by conflict and power. Investigating that history raises questions without automatically deciding whether a value is justified.",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2910,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder body",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-genealogy-of-values",
        "field": "text"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0610",
    "text": "A moral vocabulary has a contested history",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2911,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder italic caption",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-genealogy-of-values",
        "field": "item.label"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0611",
    "text": "A category gains meaning through its relations to other categories. A shared name alone does not explain its role in a social system.",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2912,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder body",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-relational-categories",
        "field": "text"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0612",
    "text": "A category gets meaning from a pattern of relations",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2913,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder italic caption",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-relational-categories",
        "field": "item.label"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0613",
    "text": "Classifications can be used to guide, train or control people. The effect depends on specific institutions and practices, not knowledge in the abstract.",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2914,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder body",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-knowledge-and-discipline",
        "field": "text"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0614",
    "text": "A classification can help organize conduct",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2915,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder italic caption",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-knowledge-and-discipline",
        "field": "item.label"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0615",
    "text": "Racial classifications can present domination as a natural order. Exposing that error does not make all biological naming and comparison useless.",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2916,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder body",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-false-natural-hierarchy",
        "field": "text"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0616",
    "text": "A classification can naturalize domination",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2917,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder italic caption",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-false-natural-hierarchy",
        "field": "item.label"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0617",
    "text": "An account can claim to include all people while excluding women or ranking racial groups as inferior. Comparing these cases exposes a gap between universal claims and practice without treating their histories as interchangeable.",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2918,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder body",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-unequal-universalism",
        "field": "text"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0618",
    "text": "A universal promise can coexist with exclusion",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2919,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder italic caption",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-unequal-universalism",
        "field": "item.label"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0619",
    "text": "An imagined critic says only originals create meaning, yet praises a word-identical later page as new. The critic's own example grants a copy the creative role the argument denies it. This identifies a particular tension, not a flaw in every text.",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2920,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder body",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-unstable-distinction",
        "field": "text"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0620",
    "text": "The original/copy hierarchy unsettles its own case",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2921,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder italic caption",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-unstable-distinction",
        "field": "item.label"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0621",
    "text": "Evidence comes from particular positions and practices, so every view has limits. A limited view can still be constrained by what is actually there.",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2922,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder body",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-situated-evidence",
        "field": "text"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0622",
    "text": "A view can be partial without being arbitrary",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2923,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder italic caption",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-situated-evidence",
        "field": "item.label"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0623",
    "text": "Different viewpoints can be compared with evidence and corrected. Recognizing partial knowledge does not require treating all claims as equally good.",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2924,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder body",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-accountable-perspectives",
        "field": "text"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0624",
    "text": "Partial perspectives can still answer to evidence",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2925,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder italic caption",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-accountable-perspectives",
        "field": "item.label"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0625",
    "text": "Distinct inherited factors can persist across generations rather than blending away. This gives an answer to the older difficulty of how variation can survive long enough for selection to act.",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2926,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder body",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-particulate-heredity",
        "field": "text"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0626",
    "text": "Inheritance need not blend differences away",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2927,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder italic caption",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-particulate-heredity",
        "field": "item.label"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0627",
    "text": "DNA provides a physical carrier for inherited differences. A molecular mechanism adds detail without explaining every trait on its own.",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2928,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder body",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-molecular-heredity",
        "field": "text"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0628",
    "text": "The inherited difference has a molecular carrier",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2929,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder italic caption",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-molecular-heredity",
        "field": "item.label"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0629",
    "text": "Inherited information works through development and environmental conditions. Understanding an organism requires more than reading its genes alone.",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2930,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder body",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-genes-in-context",
        "field": "text"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0630",
    "text": "Inherited information acts in a developing world",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2931,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder italic caption",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-genes-in-context",
        "field": "item.label"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0631",
    "text": "A habitat is a network of interacting organisms. Where they live matters together with how they feed, compete and cooperate.",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2932,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder body",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-ecosystem-relations",
        "field": "text"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0632",
    "text": "A habitat is a network of living relations",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2933,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder italic caption",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-ecosystem-relations",
        "field": "item.label"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0633",
    "text": "Fossil-fuel energy transfers long-stored carbon into the atmosphere. Industrial power therefore changes a planetary store of material.",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2934,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder body",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-carbon-energy-link",
        "field": "text"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0634",
    "text": "Industrial power changes the atmospheric store",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2935,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder italic caption",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-carbon-energy-link",
        "field": "item.label"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0635",
    "text": "More greenhouse gas changes how heat escapes to space. The warming mechanism depends on the gas's interaction with infrared radiation.",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2936,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder body",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-radiative-warming",
        "field": "text"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0636",
    "text": "Added greenhouse gas changes Earth\u2019s heat loss",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2937,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder italic caption",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-radiative-warming",
        "field": "item.label"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0637",
    "text": "Fossil-fuel emissions and greenhouse physics together explain a warming influence. The explanation is more than a correlation between two rising records.",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2938,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder body",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-climate-pressure",
        "field": "text"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0638",
    "text": "The energy system creates a warming pressure",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2939,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder italic caption",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-climate-pressure",
        "field": "item.label"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0639",
    "text": "Bubbles in dated ice preserve samples of past air. Comparing them over time gives a history of atmospheric composition, unlike a sample whose age is unknown.",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2940,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder body",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-atmospheric-history",
        "field": "text"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0640",
    "text": "The air has a readable history",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2941,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder italic caption",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-atmospheric-history",
        "field": "item.label"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0641",
    "text": "Human activity drives recent global warming through greenhouse emissions and other influences. Uncertainty about some details does not erase the physical mechanism or the wider evidence.",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2942,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder body",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-human-driven-warming",
        "field": "text"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0642",
    "text": "Human activity drives the recent warming",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2943,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder italic caption",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-human-driven-warming",
        "field": "item.label"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0643",
    "text": "Modern lead contamination can distort measurements intended to date ancient material. The sample's own lead must be separated from what the laboratory adds.",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2944,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder body",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-clean-measurement-problem",
        "field": "text"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0644",
    "text": "The laboratory can contaminate an ancient clock",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2945,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder italic caption",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-clean-measurement-problem",
        "field": "item.label"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0645",
    "text": "Geography and ecology affect what societies can do, but do not determine every event. Institutions, forced labour, individual choices and unexpected events also shape history.",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2946,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder body",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-world-history-not-destiny",
        "field": "text"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0646",
    "text": "Geography constrains history without writing it alone",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2947,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder italic caption",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-world-history-not-destiny",
        "field": "item.label"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0647",
    "text": "The imagined model is useful at finding patterns but is not an all-purpose source of truth. Its errors and limits remain part of the design.",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2948,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder body",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-predictive-assistant",
        "field": "text"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0648",
    "text": "A powerful predictor, not a universal oracle",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2949,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder italic caption",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-predictive-assistant",
        "field": "item.label"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0649",
    "text": "The model proposes a test with a method people can inspect. A useful suggestion must expose what changes, what is measured and how it can be checked.",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2950,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder body",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-trial-design-partner",
        "field": "text"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0650",
    "text": "A model proposes an experiment that people can inspect",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2951,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder italic caption",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-trial-design-partner",
        "field": "item.label"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0651",
    "text": "The observatory keeps records of how each finding was made. Inspectable evidence matters more than a polished appearance of authority.",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2952,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder body",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-provenance-rich-observatory",
        "field": "text"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0652",
    "text": "A record whose making can be examined",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2953,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder italic caption",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-provenance-rich-observatory",
        "field": "item.label"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0653",
    "text": "In the imagined observatory, a new case differs from the examples used to train the model. The prediction keeps that unfamiliarity visible instead of hiding it behind confident language.",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2954,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder body",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-uncertainty-bearing-model",
        "field": "text"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0654",
    "text": "A prediction keeps its unfamiliar case visible",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2955,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder italic caption",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-uncertainty-bearing-model",
        "field": "item.label"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0655",
    "text": "Differently designed instruments detect the same candidate event and pass local checks. Their agreement strengthens the finding, but shared errors or disturbances may still explain it.",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2956,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder body",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-cross-checked-discovery",
        "field": "text"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0656",
    "text": "A candidate survives distinct checks",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2957,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder italic caption",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-cross-checked-discovery",
        "field": "item.label"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0657",
    "text": "The observatory can adjust its observations while waiting for Earth. Feedback supports a limited local role, not unlimited machine authority.",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2958,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder body",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-remote-observation-agent",
        "field": "text"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0658",
    "text": "A local observer can act while Earth is silent",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2959,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder italic caption",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-remote-observation-agent",
        "field": "item.label"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0659",
    "text": "The system can act locally within an agreed boundary and stop for review beyond it. Responsiveness and oversight are both built into its role.",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2960,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder body",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-bounded-autonomy",
        "field": "text"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0660",
    "text": "Useful local action with a defined stopping boundary",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2961,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder italic caption",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-bounded-autonomy",
        "field": "item.label"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0661",
    "text": "The workshop combines machinery with specific rights to choose tasks and stop unsafe work. Community ownership alone would not guarantee those powers.",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2962,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder body",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-automation-with-agency",
        "field": "text"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0662",
    "text": "A workshop design reserves decisions for its makers",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2963,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder italic caption",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-automation-with-agency",
        "field": "item.label"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0663",
    "text": "The workshop values skill and the maker's experience as well as output. Its design does not promise that every necessary task becomes enjoyable.",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2964,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder body",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-workshop-for-living",
        "field": "text"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0664",
    "text": "A workshop can value skill as well as output",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2965,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder italic caption",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-workshop-for-living",
        "field": "item.label"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0665",
    "text": "The imagined workshop offers skill and pleasure in making, but care and maintenance remain demanding. A good-life proposal still has to decide how necessary work is supported and shared.",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2966,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder body",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-care-still-needed",
        "field": "text"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0666",
    "text": "Pleasurable making does not eliminate care burdens",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2967,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder italic caption",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-care-still-needed",
        "field": "item.label"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0667",
    "text": "The imagined city uses local signals to respond to urgent problems. Unlike a remote observatory, its choices directly involve conflicting human priorities.",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2968,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder body",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-responsive-city",
        "field": "text"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0668",
    "text": "A city can respond locally to urgent signals",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2969,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder italic caption",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-responsive-city",
        "field": "item.label"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0669",
    "text": "An imagined city controller can react quickly to danger, but affected residents may disagree with its priorities. Faster action leaves less time for challenge before the consequences occur.",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2970,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder body",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-control-tradeoff",
        "field": "text"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0670",
    "text": "Faster response can reduce time to challenge it",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2971,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder italic caption",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-control-tradeoff",
        "field": "item.label"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0671",
    "text": "The imagined city gives residents a way to inspect and appeal rapid decisions. This adds accountability, but cannot undo every harm or recover the time lost before an appeal is heard.",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2972,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder body",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-contestable-control",
        "field": "text"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0672",
    "text": "Rapid action has an inspectable appeal path",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2973,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder italic caption",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-contestable-control",
        "field": "item.label"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0673",
    "text": "Cooperation is supported by rules that affected people can change. Willingness to cooperate alone does not design a workable institution.",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2974,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder body",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-revisable-commons",
        "field": "text"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0674",
    "text": "Cooperation receives rules people can revise",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2975,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder italic caption",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-revisable-commons",
        "field": "item.label"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0675",
    "text": "A prosperous city need not require everyone to pursue the same life. Wealth is one consideration, not a complete definition of living well.",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2976,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder body",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-plural-good-lives",
        "field": "text"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0676",
    "text": "A prosperous city need not prescribe one good life",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2977,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder italic caption",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-plural-good-lives",
        "field": "item.label"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0677",
    "text": "Political life can be judged by what it enables people to share and achieve. Asking about a common good also raises the question of who is included.",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2978,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder body",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-civ-common-good",
        "field": "text"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0678",
    "text": "Political life judged by a common good",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2979,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder italic caption",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-civ-common-good",
        "field": "item.label"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0679",
    "text": "A government is judged by whose interests it serves, not only by how many people rule. A ruler's benefit can differ from the community's.",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2980,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder body",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-civ-rule-benefit",
        "field": "text"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0680",
    "text": "Judge rulers by whose interests they serve",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2981,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder italic caption",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-civ-rule-benefit",
        "field": "item.label"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0681",
    "text": "Living in a city does not necessarily give a person a political voice. Ancient citizenship excluded many people on whom the city depended.",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2982,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder body",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-civ-citizen-boundary",
        "field": "text"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0682",
    "text": "Living in a city does not grant a political voice",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2983,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder italic caption",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-civ-citizen-boundary",
        "field": "item.label"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0683",
    "text": "A city can claim to serve a common good while denying many inhabitants a political voice. Whose good is included, and whose interests are left out?",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2984,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder body",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-civ-bounded-common-good",
        "field": "text"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0684",
    "text": "Who is included in the common good?",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2985,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder italic caption",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-civ-bounded-common-good",
        "field": "item.label"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0685",
    "text": "Plato argues that ruling requires knowledge of what is good, not simply winning support. The claim does not settle who should be allowed a political voice.",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2986,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder body",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-civ-skilled-rule",
        "field": "text"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0686",
    "text": "Plato: ruling needs knowledge, not applause",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2987,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder italic caption",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-civ-skilled-rule",
        "field": "item.label"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0687",
    "text": "Roman law divides people by legal status in ways different from Greek political participation. Comparing the two systems does not make them identical.",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2988,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder body",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-civ-unequal-status",
        "field": "text"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C0688",
    "text": "A different legal order still divides people by status",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 2989,
        "world": "atlas-focused-sessions-v6",
        "surface": "wonder italic caption",
        "owner": "plain-atlas-civ-unequal-status",
        "field": "item.label"
      }
    ]
  }
]